<title>UK: Copper marks time near $2,550 on firm LME.</title>
<headline>Copper marks time near $2,550 on firm LME.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Firm and close to earlier one-year peak of $2,550. Spreads dominate in early ring, with cash/threes at $93/983 backwardation.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM  - Steadier above $1,620, contango narrowing.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Higher, but ranging between $7,300/7,400.</p>
<p>ZINC - Pushes higher. Closes steadier above $1,360.</p>
<p>LEAD - Quietly steady.</p>
<p>TIN - Steadier just above $5,600.</p>
<p>ALLOY - Steady/quiet.</p>
</text>
